After running the secondary orderer (default `ClassName` alphabetical), the method now detects whether the descriptors span more than one classloader:

```java
boolean multipleClassLoaders = classDescriptors.stream()
        .map(classDescriptor -> classDescriptor.getTestClass().getClassLoader())
